of it and on error exit rpcif_hb_probe() callback with error code.

Fixes: 5de15b610f78 ("mtd: hyperbus: add Renesas RPC-IF driver")
Signed-off-by: Lad Prabhakar <prabhakar.mahadev-lad.rj@bp.renesas.com>
